@startuml use-cases
title BasilCare AI - use cases (scope section 2)
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Farmer /\nfarm operator" as Farmer
actor "Administrator" as Admin
actor "Agronomist /\neducator" as Agro
actor "Raspberry Pi\ngateway" as Pi <<device>>
actor "AI assistant\n(MCP client)" as AI <<system>>

Admin --|> Farmer : can do everything\na farmer does

rectangle "BasilCare platform" {
  usecase "Sign up / sign in\n(OAuth 2.0 + PKCE)" as UC0
  usecase "View live values\nand history (FR-02)" as UC1
  usecase "Receive an alert (FR-04)" as UC2
  usecase "Acknowledge / resolve\nan incident (FR-04)" as UC3
  usecase "Start / stop the pump\n(confirmed, safety-checked)" as UC4
  usecase "Review a leaf screening\n(FR-05)" as UC5
  usecase "Ask a cultivation question\n(RAG, FR-06)" as UC6
  usecase "Register / disable a device" as UC7
  usecase "Configure alert ranges" as UC8
  usecase "Read the pump audit log" as UC9
  usecase "Read reports\n(FR-09)" as UC10
  usecase "Publish readings, status,\npump state, screenings (FR-01)" as UC11
  usecase "Apply local pump\nsafety rules" as UC12
  usecase "Detect incidents\n(thresholds, stale, offline,\npump fault, invalid data)" as UC13
  usecase "Read history / request\nactions through MCP tools (FR-07)" as UC14
}

Farmer --> UC0
Farmer --> UC1
Farmer --> UC2
Farmer --> UC3
Farmer --> UC4
Farmer --> UC5
Farmer --> UC6
Agro --> UC1
Agro --> UC6
Agro --> UC10
Admin --> UC7
Admin --> UC8
Admin --> UC9
Admin --> UC10
Pi --> UC11
UC4 ..> UC12 : <<include>>\n(re-checked on the device)
UC11 ..> UC13 : <<include>>
UC13 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
AI --> UC14
UC14 ..> UC4 : <<extend>>\nonly after the user confirms

note right of UC6
  planned (ai-service/),
  not implemented yet
end note
note right of UC10
  planned
end note
@enduml
